Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： HSQ-Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕時間軸由kewenyu調整以適應當前作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:09.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太陽風速度不變
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:13.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,耀斑等級S3 預測離到達還有30秒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:16.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快 9號機情況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:17.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 快了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,高速粒子確認到達
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:23.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,耀斑馬達啟動倒計時開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:25.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,10
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:25.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,9
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:26.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,8
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:27.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,7
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:29.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:29.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:30.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:31.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:32.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.19,0:00:34.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,粒子到達
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:35.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,耀斑馬達啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:46.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius7 開始移動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿蘭 克裏斯丁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:54.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣我終於可以對你們有個交代
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:07.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 我們的墓碑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:11.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,忘記悲鳴 不敢正視現實
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.37,0:01:14.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對這個再次被欺騙注滿的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.31,0:01:16.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要把它終結
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.34,0:00:00.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:49.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius7 又加速2%
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.93,0:02:52.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,依然是與地球相撞軌道 005
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:55.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:59.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣大的品質 不可能輕易改變軌道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:01.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和密涅瓦上的議長聯繫上了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:03.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的在朝地球去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.09,0:03:05.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回避的方法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.65,0:03:07.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎樣向地球發出警告
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:21.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 最高評議會給狄蘭達爾議長打來的一號頻道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:32.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.79,0:03:36.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius7在移動？到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:40.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這還無從知曉 但的確在移動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:43.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還已相當快的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:45.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在最危險的軌道上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:48.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這件事本艦也已經確認
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:51.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但為什麼會發生這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:55.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是以百年單位計算的穩定軌道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:04:00.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是隕石撞擊還是其他原因造成
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:03.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之是在運動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:05.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與此同時
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:07.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,朝著地球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:08.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,落下的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.63,0:04:11.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,落下的話會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:13.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布 不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:17.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種品質的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:21.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用多說公主也該明白
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:28.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT也正為探明原因和尋找解決手段傾盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.21,0:04:33.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為接二連三的意外向公主深表歉意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:38.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我已下令密涅瓦緊急搶修後
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻趕往Junius7
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:43.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所幸位置臨近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:47.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望公主也能予以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:50.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 這對我們來說...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.21,0:04:54.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 對我方來說也是重大事件
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:58.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也希望做一些力所能及的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很理解你的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:03.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但請鎮靜下來 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:07.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如有需要 我們會主動提出
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然有一定難度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:13.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會嘗試讓您與本國取得聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.55,0:05:18.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也會安排船隻儘早前來迎接
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 有勞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會是那東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:31.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是隕石撞擊 還是因為什麼原因改變軌道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:35.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據說是與地球相撞的路線 真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.95,0:05:38.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴特是這麼說的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:42.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Armory剛剛遭劫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:47.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒料理完又來這個 到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:51.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:57.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次該把那個Junius7怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:04.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有擊碎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:06.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擊碎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.13,0:06:07.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把那東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:13.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能改變軌道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:17.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想避免相撞的話只有擊碎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:20.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:22.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算碎成原來的一半
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最長部分有八公里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:27.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種東西該怎麼打碎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:31.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且那裏還有很多人的遺體
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:36.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但相撞的話地球會毀滅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:39.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到那時候 什麼都不會留下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:41.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,生活在那裏的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:46.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球滅亡...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:47.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:49.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:56.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說沒辦法還真是沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:58.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可抗力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:02.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過那些無聊的糾紛消失個乾乾淨淨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.59,0:07:06.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定會更輕鬆 對我們PLANT來說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:10.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,虧你們說得出這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:12.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:14.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定會更輕鬆？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:16.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道這是什麼事態嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:17.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道地球會怎麼樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:20.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道多少人會死去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的瞭解嗎 你們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:25.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:30.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是這種想法 你們紮夫特
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.77,0:07:34.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,經過那樣的戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有過那種經歷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:39.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於在狄蘭達爾議長的治理下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是沒有改變嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.27,0:07:42.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:47.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤蘭也不是認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:52.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這點事都不明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:53.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:54.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:56.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 注意措辭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:02.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 這個人是大人物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:04.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰讓她是奧布的首相呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:05.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:07.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以了 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:16.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看得出你很討厭奧布 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:20.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據說以前住在奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:24.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果因為些無聊的原因對毫無關係的首相無禮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:26.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會輕易放過的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.53,0:08:28.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無聊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:31.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你敢說無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:34.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說無關也大錯特錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的家人被阿斯哈殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:43.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,相信國家 相信你們那些理想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:47.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到最後的最後 在初島被殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我不會相信你們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:54.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不會相信奧布這種國家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.39,0:08:57.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會相信你們說的漂亮話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:07.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼貫徹這個國家的正義
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:14.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們那個時候考慮過有人會為自己這句話去死嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:24.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼都不懂的傢伙不要說些看似什麼都懂的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:31.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:52.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 這真是不得了的事態啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:54.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直是史無前例的危機
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:57.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球滅亡的劇本啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:02.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有人撰寫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:06.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命令PhantomPaine調查後再返回
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:08.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:10.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:15.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今調查那種東西有用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:17.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正是要調查這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:21.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這次集合是怎麼回事 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:26.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 以大西洋聯邦為首的各國政府
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:30.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不至於讓那東西就這樣墜落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:34.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過大家避難和對策也有的忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:42.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,老實說對這次事件 我也相當震驚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:47.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius7竟然會...到底是為何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:51.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最先想到的儘是這些
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:54.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前言就免了 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.10,0:10:57.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 這才是重點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:03.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對於這種事態 全世界人都會這麼想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:09.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們也必須給予他們答案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:17.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT的狄蘭達爾已向地球各國發出警告
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:21.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還發來了正全力應對的資訊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:24.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應對真快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:26.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們也慌了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.59,0:11:30.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼這該不會真的是自然現象吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:32.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這樣的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:36.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那些都已經無所謂了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:40.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重點是這場災難之後
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:46.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們給遭受無妄之災的民眾以何種答案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:50.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 已經算計到哪一步了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:51.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:53.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論原因是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:57.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那堆難看且愚蠢的垃圾即將落入地球
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:12:01.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會落在我們頭上這點是毫無疑問的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:04.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:11.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了那種東西 連我們都得驚慌失色四處逃散不可
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:18.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這屈辱無論如何都得討回
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:20.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:25.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是在宇宙中四處建造那種東西的調整者們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:27.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:31.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這當然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:33.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然而這麼一來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:39.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,蒙受的損失會使我們喪失進行戰爭的體力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:42.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以今天才召集大家來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:46.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,避難逃離都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:49.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之後我們要一口氣討回
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:51.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用那個計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.43,0:12:56.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了讓大家對這件事有所瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:12:58.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夠強硬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:06.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,民眾們對調整者的仇恨反而會化為力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:07.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果倖存的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:10.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,團結倖存的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:12.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用名為仇恨的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:18.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家對計畫似乎沒有異議了 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:19.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:23.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那下次要等事件發生後了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:25.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你到那時準備好詳細的具體計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:26.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.04,0:13:31.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 會造成多大損失呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:34.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭倒無所謂 這種東西挺讓人頭疼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:38.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎樣 都是為了藍色清淨的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:54.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伏爾泰號和盧梭號攜帶隕石破壞器已經先走一步
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:56.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我們也趕快把
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:13:59.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍方面沒有什麼行動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:01.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.33,0:14:04.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒收到任何聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:08.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過就算從月球出動艦船也來不及吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:13.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的只有從地表上發射導彈摧毀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:16.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這樣最多燒毀表面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:18.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會有太大作用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:23.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,話雖如此 地球是我們母親般的大地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,面對前所未有的危急
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:27.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也必須盡自己所能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:32.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,靠這艘船的裝備 也許能做的事不多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:34.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也要竭盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:35.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:42.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:56.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多想也沒用 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:15:00.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該早就明白的 也有那種人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:02.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.09,0:15:23.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,父親被說成那樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:26.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,父親也是在痛苦中做出決定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:27.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但卻...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:31.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:36.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算讓他理解 現在的他也無法做到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:41.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定只顧著自己的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:48.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白的吧 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:03.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在看起來 還真大呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:08.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了 我們就住在類似的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:14.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在感慨這次敲碎它的任務有多艱巨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:18.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說 時間沒那麼充足
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:20.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦也會來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:21.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,乾淨利索點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:22.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:25.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認裝藥完成
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:30.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,破壞器一號到四號把點火係數設定為215
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:33.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其他設定為738
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.35,0:16:54.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎 公主她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:17:01.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她也在那場戰爭中失去了父親和朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:05.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是什麼都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:19.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.29,0:17:21.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:25.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用在意 我也沒在意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:28.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你說得對
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:32.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離Junius7 1200
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:34.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,顯示光學映射
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能打開伏爾泰號的通訊線路嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:40.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 普通線路還未回復
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:42.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:44.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 阿雷克斯君
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:48.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道是勉為其難的請求
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請借我MS一用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:02.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確是勉為其難
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:07.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,身為他國百姓 你認為能下達這種許可嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:12.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想浪費卡納巴前議長的一片苦心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:13.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:17.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這種情況下無法坐視不管
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:20.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有能用的機體 懇請...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.21,0:18:24.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心情我能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:25.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:29.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我許可 作為議長許可權的特例
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:30.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:38.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是議長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:40.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是去戰鬥 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:44.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能出動的機體越多越好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:48.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也該知道他技術了得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:55.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:58.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:18:59.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,GINN？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:02.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事 哪里的機體
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:05.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不明 IFF沒有回應
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.81,0:19:06.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.43,0:19:13.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏會有紮夫特的MS 是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:15.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.51,0:19:20.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定這次騷動並非出於捉摸不定的上天之手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:24.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓司丁克他們出動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:25.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看看情況
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:27.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,記錄也盡可能多收集
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:30.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS出擊三分鐘前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各機師到機體內待機
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:35.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複 出擊三分鐘前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:38.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼粉碎作業的支援
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:40.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該做些什麼才好？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:41.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:44.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據說那傢伙也去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:48.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,支援工作多一台也好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:52.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為人家能開MS嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:54.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:56.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS出擊一分鐘前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:20:00.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴他們抵達後遵從玖爾隊長的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.77,0:20:04.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在Junius7檢測到類似戰鬥熱分佈 是MS
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:07.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊停止 情況變化
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:10.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,玖爾隊在Junius7與不明部隊交戰中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:12.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊紮克？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:13.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不明？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.49,0:20:18.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各機請將裝備更換為對MS戰用
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.87,0:20:21.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又確認到BogeyOne Green25 Delta
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:23.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘船？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:27.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.53,0:20:28.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:32.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但本艦的任務是支援玖爾隊這點沒變
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:35.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,換裝完成後各機出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:46.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,中央彈射器啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:50.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊區域開始減壓程式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:52.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,工作人員請待機
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:55.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,核心戰機全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始出擊程式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:00.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連Bogey都來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:11.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,情況有變化了呢 很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:14.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不如作罷？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:16.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別小看人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:22.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真·飛鳥 核心戰機出發
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:52.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷·查·巴勒路 Zaku出擊
